The learned Tribunal on analysis of both oral and documentary evidence, framed certain points for determination like:
(i) Whether the accident happened due to the negligent driving of the Driver of the car;
(ii) Whether the claimants have proved the relationship with the deceased;
(iii) Whether said Gowri who claims to be the wife of the deceased has proved her relationship and ;
